#                                                               ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠙⢿⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
#   P3RPod
                                      ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀  ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠈⠀

#__WPS File

#__Hide the status bar
%wd

#__Backdrop
%xl(backdrop,p3rmenu.bmp,0,0)
%xl(lockscreen,p3rpodLock.bmp,0,0)
%V(0,0,-,-,-)%VB
%?mh<%xd(lockscreen)|%xd(backdrop)>
%V(0,0,-,-,-)

#__Preload fonts
%Fl(3,15-RodinProEB.fnt)
%Fl(4,24-RodinProEB.fnt)
%Fl(5,15-NewRodinProDB.fnt)
%Fl(6,30-RodinProEB.fnt)

#__Preload images
%xl(H,BatteryStatus.bmp,12)
%xl(PBB,pb_back.bmp,0,0)
%xl(PB,pb.bmp,0,0)
%xl(VBB,vb_back.bmp,0,0)
%xl(VB,vb.bmp,0,0)
%xl(PBI,Playback_Icons.bmp,5)

%xl(darkhour,DarkHour.bmp,0,0)
%xl(lateatnight,LateAtNight.bmp,0,0)
%xl(earlymorning,EarlyMorning.bmp,0,0)
%xl(morning,Morning.bmp,0,0)
%xl(daytime,Daytime.bmp,0,0)
%xl(afternoon,Afternoon.bmp,0,0)
%xl(nighttime,Nighttime.bmp,0,0)

%?mh<%Vd(LockScreen)|%Vd(MainDisplay)>

#----------- Main Display ---------#

#__Clear Screen - first member; repaints the backdrop on every refresh so nothing blanks on Hold
%Vl(MainDisplay,0,0,320,240,-)

#__Volume Text
%Vl(MainDisplay,221,34,80,31,5)%Vf(000000)
%ar%?mh<LOCKED|Vol. %pv dB>

#__Battery Text
%Vl(MainDisplay,230,16,45,15,5)%Vf(000000)
%ar%bl%%

#__Battery Icon
%Vl(MainDisplay,280,17,21,11,-)%Vf(000000)
%?bp<%xd(Hl)|%?bl<%xd(Ha)|%xd(Hb)|%xd(Hc)|%xd(Hd)|%xd(He)|%xd(Hf)|%xd(Hg)|%xd(Hh)|%xd(Hi)|%xd(Hj)|%xd(Hk)>>

#__Time of Day
%Vl(MainDisplay,0,14,201,25,-)
%?if(%ck,=,0)<%xd(darkhour)|>
%?and(%if(%ck, >=, 1),%if(%ck, <, 4))<%xd(lateatnight)>
%?and(%if(%ck, >=, 4),%if(%ck, <, 7))<%xd(earlymorning)>
%?and(%if(%ck, >=, 7),%if(%ck, <, 11))<%xd(morning)>
%?and(%if(%ck, >=, 11),%if(%ck, <, 15))<%xd(daytime)>
%?and(%if(%ck, >=, 15),%if(%ck, <, 19))<%xd(afternoon)>
%?and(%if(%ck, >=, 19),%if(%ck, <, 23))<%xd(nighttime)>
%?if(%ck,=,23)<%xd(lateatnight)|>

%Vl(MainDisplay,0,45,45,15,5)%Vf(000000)
%al%cH:%cM

#__Track Progress Bar
%Vl(MainDisplay,20,194,280,1,-)
%dr(0,0,280,1)
%Vl(MainDisplay,20,195,280,5,-)
%pb(0,0,280,5,PBB,slider,PB)
%Vl(MainDisplay,20,200,280,1,-)
%dr(0,0,280,1)

#__Album Art
%Vl(MainDisplay,21,69,114,114,-)
%Cl(1,1,112,112,c,c)
%dr(0,0,114,1)%dr(0,113,114,1)%dr(0,1,1,112)%dr(113,1,1,112)
%Cd

#__Track Title
%Vl(MainDisplay,142,85,158,42,4)%Vf(ff2c39)
%al%s%?it<%it|%fn>

#__Artist
%Vl(MainDisplay,142,110,158,17,3)
%al%s%?ia<%ia|NO TAG>

#__Album
%Vl(MainDisplay,142,130,158,17,3)
%al%s%?id<%id|NO ALBUM>

#__File Info
%Vl(MainDisplay,142,150,165,17,3)
%al%s%fc | %fk kHz

#__Track Time / Playlist position / Clock
%Vl(MainDisplay,20,213,280,20,3)
%al     %pc%ac%pp/%pe%ar-%pr

#__Play/Pause Icon
%Vl(MainDisplay,20,214,21,11,-)
%?mp<%xd(PBI,1)|%xd(PBI,3)|%xd(PBI,2)|%xd(PBI,4)|%xd(PBI,5)>

#----------- Lock Screen ----------#

#__Clock
%Vl(LockScreen,115,135,200,30,6)
%ac%cH:%cM:%cS
# %alLOCKED

#__Calendar
%Vl(LockScreen,115,166,200,20,3)
%ac%ca.%, %cb. %ce